# WITNESS_II_EXTENDED

The program I usually run on my Protogen head.

# SPECIFICATIONS

ESP32 + 2x 64x32 HUB75 P3 LED panels.

The library used is this one: https://github.com/mrcodetastic/ESP32-HUB75-MatrixPanel-DMA/tree/master/examples/1_SimpleTestShapes. The panels are connected in series. The panel on the right side of the head is first to receive data from the ESP32, input at the front and output at the back. The left side panel receives the right panel's data output as input.

# DEPENDENCIES

- RTTI enabled

The following libraries:
- https://github.com/WW92030-STORAGE/WITNESS_CLONE_II
- https://github.com/WW92030-STORAGE/VORONOI as Voronoi
- https://github.com/WW92030-STORAGE/miscellaneous/tree/main/FIRE
- https://github.com/WW92030-STORAGE/MANDELBROT
- https://github.com/WW92030-STORAGE/miscellaneous/tree/main/CONWAY

# COMPILING THIS

I use Arduino IDE. Results might vary with other platforms.
